<v Maya>They rolled back a cluttered redesign and folded features into ChatGPT,

251
00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.120
<v Maya>but still lost Sora.

252
00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:14.180
<v Maya>So what about the Apple delays, Alex?

253
00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.500
<v Alex>They kept pushing Siri back because of bugs and engineering issues.

254
00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:19.300
<v Maya>That’s the usual.

255
00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:25.380
<v Alex>Yeah, and the $250 million settlement came after the iPhone 16 launch.

256
00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:25.820
<v Maya>Oh?

257
00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:26.780
<v Maya>What did Apple say?

258
00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.740
<v Alex>They blamed the delay on technical hurdles, a typical excuse.

259
00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.660
<v Maya>And Sora—why did it fail so fast?

260
00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:36.240
<v Alex>High operating costs and low retention.

261
00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.530
<v Maya>It shows the market’s harsh test.

262
00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.080
<v Alex>Character.ai and Ollie—both shut down.

263
00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.000
<v Maya>They couldn't keep up.

264
00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.420
<v Alex>OpenAI's super app?

265
00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:47.500
