266
00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:52.660
<v Alex>Apple keeps delaying Siri, then a $250 million settlement.

267
00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:57.200
<v Maya>So the lesson is that hype alone won’t survive without solid demand.

268
00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.420
<v Maya>Alex, Nvidia's CEO spot—what's the buzz?

269
00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:03.780
<v Alex>Nvidia’s hiring, yeah.

270
00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.980
<v Alex>They’re looking for a new head.

271
00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.040
<v Maya>It’s not just a tech shift.

272
00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.100
<v Maya>The market is watching.

273
00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:10.080
<v Alex>Hold on, what about the numbers?

274
00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:15.780
<v Maya>Anthropic is eyeing a $1.4 trillion IPO, but that’s a side note.

275
00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.400
