276
00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:21.660
<v Maya>The timing feels tight.

277
00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:25.150
<v Alex>I think it’s a signal that the AI race is heating up.

278
00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.660
<v Alex>Wait, who exactly’s filing?

279
00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:27.580
<v Alex>And the numbers?

280
00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:35.040
