00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:28.420
<v Alex>That’s a tight timeline.

364
00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:33.220
<v Maya>Kress has to walk that tightrope while answering the board’s questions on supply

365
00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.800
<v Maya>constraints and future growth.

366
00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:39.720
<v Maya>I think it’s pretty clear that the market isn’t buying the denials about China.

367
00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.560
<v Maya>Six weeks of losses is a reaction, Alex.

